# Quality bar

- No TODOs / FIXME / placeholders / fake success on in-scope production paths
- No silent failures — errors must surface; do not swallow exceptions that drop work
- Production code must be complete before marking work complete
- Never weaken security, tests, logging, validation, or architecture just to pass CI
- Prefer existing project patterns
